WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:16.130
is ridiculous!"

2
00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:20.432
Lord Hong frowned at his wife and the face-reader.

3
00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:23.173
"Gildong will never become a king.

4
00:00:24.153 --> 00:00:27.415
Besides, the kingdom already has a king and plenty of heirs."

5
00:00:28.675 --> 00:00:30.056
Choonja bowed her head.

6
00:00:31.604 --> 00:00:32.905
"I only speak of what I see.

7
00:00:33.725 --> 00:00:36.586
And Gildong's fortune puts you all in danger."

8
00:00:36.606 --> 00:00:43.289
"If he causes any trouble, we'll all be punished," Lady Yoo said.

9
00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:47.051
"Gildong could destroy this family.

10
00:00:47.891 --> 00:00:51.512
You must do something, Husband."

11
00:00:53.693 --> 00:00:55.314
Lord Hong looked at Choonja.

12
00:00:55.334 --> 00:00:57.275
"Leave right now.

13
00:00:58.075 --> 00:01:00.016
And never speak a word of this to anyone."

14
00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.961
Lord Hong went to his room.

15
00:01:11.323 --> 00:01:13.984
He stayed there alone all night, thinking.

16
00:01:18.806 --> 00:01:21.027
In the morning he summoned Gildong.

17
00:01:25.909 --> 00:01:27.129
wanted to see me, Your Lordship?"

18
00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:28.390
Gildong asked.

19
00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:33.032
"I'm sending you away," Lord Hong said flatly.

20
00:01:33.932 --> 00:01:36.134
Gildong looked at him, surprised.

21
00:01:36.154 --> 00:01:37.915
"Sending me away?

22
00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:39.617
Where? Why?"

23
00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:46.062
is a cottage in the mountains," Lord Hong said.

24
00:01:46.082 --> 00:01:49.365
"You must stay there and never leave.

25
00:01:50.305 --> 00:01:52.347
A servant will bring your meals every day.

26
00:01:53.588 --> 00:01:55.209
You can ask for anything you need.

27
00:01:56.911 --> 00:01:58.712
But you may never return here again."

28
00:01:58.732 --> 00:02:03.116
"Have I done something wrong, Your Lordship?

29
00:02:03.692 --> 00:02:05.252
Why am I being punished again?"

30
00:02:05.633 --> 00:02:06.573
Gildong asked.

31
00:02:07.493 --> 00:02:08.833
Tears filled his eyes.

32
00:02:10.954 --> 00:02:12.194
Lord Hong looked down.

33
00:02:12.214 --> 00:02:14.635
"This is for your own good.

34
00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.036
Good-bye, Gildong."

35
00:02:25.558 --> 00:02:28.539
Life at the mountain cottage was boring for Gildong.

36
00:02:29.819 --> 00:02:32.540
Every day a servant brought food and a book.

37
00:02:36.396 --> 00:02:40.079
Gildong spent his days walking in circles in the yard.

38
00:02:42.601 --> 00:02:44.523
He read and reread books.

39
00:02:44.543 --> 00:02:47.945
"I was lonely before.

40
00:02:48.986 --> 00:02:51.128
Now I'm even more alone," he thought.

41
00:03:00.575 --> 00:03:03.217
One day he saw a shimmer outside.

42
00:03:04.438 --> 00:03:06.080
It was the silver thread again!

43
00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:13.365
Gildong wasn't supposed to leave the cottage.

44
00:03:14.345 --> 00:03:16.486
But he had to see where the thread led.

45
00:03:17.387 --> 00:03:19.348
Quickly he began following it.

46
00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:25.350
The thread led away from the cottage and deep into the woods.

47
00:03:27.291 --> 00:03:29.732
Finally Gildong arrived at a cliff.

48
00:03:30.992 --> 00:03:33.353
The silver thread went over the edge.

49
00:03:35.174 --> 00:03:37.215
Gildong carefully crept closer.

50
00:03:38.576 --> 00:03:41.845
As he did, his robe got caught on a tree branch.

51
00:03:43.286 --> 00:03:47.527
He spun around, and suddenly the rock beneath him broke away.

52
00:03:51.749 --> 00:03:53.630
He was falling—fast!

53
00:03:58.932 --> 00:04:02.134
Later that evening a servant came to Lord Hong.

54
00:04:02.154 --> 00:04:07.636
"My Lord, Master Gildong was not at the cottage today.

55
00:04:08.364 --> 00:04:11.366
When we searched the mountain, we found this by a cliff's edge."

56
00:04:12.366 --> 00:04:14.908
The servant held out a piece of blue cloth.

57
00:04:16.368 --> 00:04:18.550
Lord Hong took the cloth in his hands.

58
00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:22.092
"This is from Gildong's robe," he said.

59
00:04:22.112 --> 00:04:27.134
"We fear The servant bit his lip.

60
00:04:27.154 --> 00:04:29.676
"Master Gildong is dead."
